Package: freex-desktop
Version: [[version]]
Section: video
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Niklas Linz <niklas.linz@mirranet.de>
Depends: libwebkit2gtk-4.1-0 (>= 2.40), libgtk-3-0, libdbus-1-3, libayatana-appindicator3-1, mpv, libc6 (>= 2.34)
Recommends: gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-plugins-bad, gstreamer1.0-libav, mpv-mpris
Homepage: https://github.com/FreeX-Studio/freex-desktop
Description: FreeX Desktop - Your Media. Your Server. Your Freedom.
 The desktop app for FreeX Media Server. It connects to your server and shows
 its interface in an app window, with your servers in one place, playback of
 every file directly in mpv inside the window (no conversion on the server),
 media keys, real full screen and a tray icon.
 .
 The GStreamer plugins are needed for the built-in FreeX player; mpv-mpris
 lets the media keys and the desktop's media controls drive mpv.
